  unitName: Peacock Xena Estelle
  unitId: 30706
  unitNumber: 1208
  description: When a demon suddenly appeared in Randall, Estelle was asked to create
    a plan of attack with the commanding officer. However, she lacked the necessary
    information in order to make a foolproof plan until Farzen divulged what he knew.
    Having learned the information she needed, Estelle created a plan to beat the
    demon and informed all forces involved. Apparently, the demon had incredible
    powers of recovery when near death, and thus a blow that would end its life before
    it had the chance to recover would be crucial to their success. After relaying
    this information, Estelle headed towards the battlefield to protect the person
    in charge of landing said attack.
  summonDesc: That group was full of troublemakers.<br>But Rouche gathered them all.<br>Those
    like him will build the future.
  fusionDesc: I wanna become General Weiss's bird!<br>It's not like I can, but...<br>It's
    just a fantasy of mine!
  evoDesc: The cheap copy of an original.<br>Is that all I amount to?<br>I'm afraid
    the bar was set too high.
